    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there's help, but it feels so superficial. like people are just trying to patch a hole that's actually a canyon. everything i built was based on this spark, this \"vision\"... and now that the spark is dead, what am i even doing here? i'm just taking up breath and space that someone with actual purpose could use.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
